  "summary_en": "Opinion of France's Defence Ethics Committee distinguishing fully autonomous lethal weapon systems (SALA), which France should refuse to use, manufacture or export, from lethal systems integrating autonomy under human command (SALIA), which are permissible under conditions. It sets six principles and 25 recommendations on command, risk control, legal review, training and trust.",
